'''Madame Eleanor Q. Goldsworth X''' is an [[NPC]] on {{Zone|The Mountaintop}} in the [[Rift Dimension]]. They give the player a {{Skill|Combat}}-related quest outside the Rift.

== Purpose ==
'''Madame Eleanor Q. Goldsworth X''' gives the player a [[Combat]] quest that they must complete outside the Rift.

Behind the nearby mirror, a replica of the player is shown fighting with a {{Item|Raider Axe}} in {{zone|Arachne's Burrow}} while equipped with {{Item|Strong Dragon Armor}} and a {{Lv|1}} {{Item|Wolf Pet|rarity=leg}}.

To complete the quest, all of the following conditions must be met at the same time:
* Wearing a full Armor set of {{Item|Strong Dragon Armor}}, {{Item|Rampart Armor}}, {{Item|Perfect Armor}} (Tier 12), {{Item|Berserker Armor}}, {{Item|Rekindled Ember Armor}}, {{Item|Frozen Blaze Armor}}, {{Item|Young Dragon Armor}}, {{Item|Wise Dragon Armor}}, {{Item|Protector Dragon Armor}}, {{Item|Old Dragon Armor}}, {{Item|Superior Dragon Armor}}, {{Item|Unstable Dragon Armor}}, {{Item|Reaper Armor}}, {{Item|Final Destination Armor}}, {{Item|Crimson Hunter Set}}, {{Item|Aurora Armor}}, {{Item|Fervor Armor}}, {{Item|Hollow Armor}}, {{Item|Terror Armor}}, {{Item|Necromancer Lord Armor}}, {{Item|Wither Armor}}, {{Item|Necron's Armor}}, {{Item|Storm's Armor}}, {{Item|Goldor's Armor}}, {{Item|Maxor's Armor}}, {{Item|Crimson Armor}}, {{Item|Hot Crimson Armor}}, {{Item|Burning Crimson Armor}}, {{Item|Fiery Crimson Armor}} or {{Item|Infernal Crimson Armor}}
* Equipping one of the following pets of {{Legendary}} rarity or higher: {{Item|Wolf Pet}}, {{Item|Ender Dragon Pet}}, {{Item|Golden Dragon Pet}}, {{Item|Enderman Pet}}, {{Item|Kuudra Pet}}, {{Item|Phoenix Pet}} or {{Item|Tiger Pet}}
* Holding any of the following Weapons: {{Item|Enrager}}, {{Item|Halberd of the Shredded}}, {{Item|Soul Whip}}, {{Item|Midas' Sword}}, {{Item|Yeti Sword}}, {{Item|Silk-Edge Sword}}, {{Item|Florid Zombie Sword}}, {{Item|Gemstone Gauntlet}}, {{Item|Phantom Rod}}, {{Item|Pigman Sword}}, {{Item|Aspect of the Dragons}}, {{Item|Atomsplit Katana}}, {{Item|Reaper Scythe}}, {{Item|Livid Dagger}}, {{Item|Shadow Fury}}, {{Item|Flower of Truth}}, {{Item|Wither Cloak Sword}}, {{Item|Necromancer Sword}}, {{Item|Giant's Sword}}, {{Item|Necron's Blade}}, {{Item|Hyperion}}, {{Item|Astraea}}, {{Item|Scylla}}, {{Item|Valkyrie}}, {{Item|Dark Claymore}} or {{Item|Raider Axe}}
* Being within {{zone|Arachne's Burrow}} or {{zone|Arachne's Sanctuary}} in the {{zone|Spider's Den}}
** Vanishing by leaving the island via a command, such as {{Code|/hub}}, or disconnecting

Once completed, the message "''{{Mctxt|f|You sense a watchful presence...}}''" will appear in chat. The player can then return to '''Madame Eleanor Q. Goldsworth X''' to complete the mirror-related puzzle.

After completing all mirror-related puzzles, the player can purchase {{Item|Shen's Ringalia}} for {{Motes|25000}}, {{Item|Puff Crux|amount=64}}, {{Item|Youngite|amount=20}}, {{Item|Timite|amount=20}}, {{Item|Obsolite|amount=20}} and {{Item|Disinfestor Gloves|amount=1}}.

